[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=22 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山把保险柜的钥匙放在桌上，却没有开柜。她先问起那个取水点，问水管修到了哪一段，问留下值守的船还有多少补给。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你是想先把这些问完，再决定告诉我多少？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="有一点。我也在拖时间，这你看出来了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她没有拿工作来挡。你原本准备的一长串追问，一时不知道从哪句接。弗莱彻把原件放到桌上，按页码排好，给你留出面对她的位置。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你认识写“手动中止”的人？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="认识其中一个。她写字总会漏掉日期，所以旁边那个人替她补。你拿回来的是她们交接过的原件。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="你为什么没早点说？"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="我以为那部分记录已经沉了。也以为只要不再提，就没有人需要重新面对它。后面那句，是我的错。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她推来一页纸。纸上的人名被折进去，只露出最后一段：重启不能恢复已失去的个体。保留记录，不等于承诺归还。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="教团把这一段删了？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="删了，也可能改过很多别的地方。我不能用我记得的几句话代替完整证据。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那我和那道门是什么关系？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="旧金山的手停在杯子旁边。你看到她想去拿杯，又改变了主意。她没有立刻回答，这次你没有替她找一个容易接受的理由。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="你可能被系统识别过。识别可以来自权限、旧记录，甚至错误。我不知道是哪一个。下一站的灯塔保存着更早的交接表，潮痕会同行。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你明知道我会想去。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="是。所以我得把危险说在前面，而不是只把一张任务单交给弗莱彻。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们也会看。不是送他到门口，再等一个人回来告诉我们结果。"

tone="concern"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你把那一页纸翻到背面。那里没有隐藏的答案，只有一圈旧茶渍。你忽然很想知道，当年写下这句话的人，后来有没有来得及回去吃饭。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="sanfrancisco"

speaker_name=""

text="不知道。以后你再问起这样的事，我不知道的时候，会直接这么说。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["sanfrancisco", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={"fletcher": "concern"}

